:: day0_void_futa [nobr]
<h2>Void   Two Channels</h2>

<<locationImage "void_futa" "Two threads of light, running parallel through the void">>

<p>Nothing.</p>

<p>The same void. The same absence. But the absence is shaped differently   not the total surrender of the full transformation, but a void that holds two things in suspension. Like a river that has split into two channels and runs parallel, each carrying the same water in different directions, each arriving at the same sea.</p>

<p>Somewhere far away: lute strings. Ash on the bridge. Waiting for someone to emerge from the tower who is neither the prince they knew nor the princess the world expects, but something between. Something that Ash   half-elf, half-human, perpetually between   might understand better than anyone.</p>

<p>Somewhere closer: a heartbeat. Mine. New. Beating in a chest that holds breasts and a body that holds both, and the rhythm is steady, and the rhythm is complicated, and the rhythm is mine.</p>

<p>The darkness thins. Light gathers.</p>

<p>Not yet. Not yet.</p>

<p>The darkness holds me. The last space where I am neither one thing nor the other. The last mercy before I have to be both.</p>

<<set $d0_void to true>>

